---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Contact | JP Web Design"
  description="Talk to JP Silva about your website project. Email directly, or use the planner to get a structure and timeline first."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="mark"><b>§01</b> Contact</p>
      <div class="head">
        <h1 class="display">Tell me about your business</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          The first conversation is about understanding what you do and who you are trying
          to reach. No pitch, and no obligation to go further.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="ct">
        <div class="ct__col">
          <h2 class="h3">Email me directly</h2>
          <p class="small ct__p">
            Fastest route, and it reaches me rather than a form queue. Tell me what the
            business does and what is not working — that is enough to start.
          </p>
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="mailto:jp@jpwebdesign.com">jp@jpwebdesign.com</a>
        </div>

        <div class="ct__col">
          <h2 class="h3">Get a plan first</h2>
          <p class="small ct__p">
            Eight questions, about four minutes. You get a page structure, a feature set and
            a timeline on screen before you give me anything at all.
          </p>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/#planner">Open the planner</a>
        </div>

        <div class="ct__col">
          <h2 class="h3">Prefer to talk?</h2>
          <p class="small ct__p">
            A phone number a human answers is going up before launch. Until then, email is
            the reliable route and I answer it myself.
          </p>
          <p class="todo">Phone — to be added before launch</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="note ct__sla">
        <span class="lbl">What happens next</span>
        <p class="small">
          I reply to every inquiry within one business day. If I do not, email me again and
          say so — that is a promise about my responsiveness, not about your results.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .ct { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--s6); }
  @media (max-width: 56rem) { .ct { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s6); } }
  .ct__col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; gap: var(--s3);
             padding-top: var(--s4); border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .ct__p { max-width: 34ch; }
  .ct__col .btn { margin-top: var(--s2); }
  .todo { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--redline); margin-top: var(--s2); }
  .ct__sla { margin-top: var(--s7); max-width: 52rem; }
</style>
